    "hope": {
      "type": "story-text",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "What I hope Tabi becomes",
        "heading_breaks_mobile": false,
        "text": "<p>I have come to value quality over quantity, and the pleasure of choosing something because it genuinely means something to me.</p><p>I wanted Tabi to reflect that feeling.</p><p>A place where my love for textiles and craft could come together with a gentler, more mindful way of living.</p><p>We began with clothing because it is the world I know best. But I've always imagined Tabi finding its way into other parts of everyday life, too.</p><p>There is still so much I want to explore, learn and make.</p><p>Tabi is my journey, but I hope there is room in it for yours.</p>",
        "text_style": "body",
        "text_font": "heading",
        "width": "narrow",
        "text_align": "left",
        "text_align_mobile": "left",
        "show_rule": false,
